# BUILDER'S STONES: the stone a Builder's hut puts into its work - small grey stones that fly from its focus crystal to
# the building it builds or repairs. Drawn through ParticleSystem::emitStream (the game's StructureSystem::drawBuilderStreams),
# which places the emitter on the line for a frame and sets `Life` from the line's length: so `Rate` is 0 and `Life` is
# unused here. `Speed` is the flight speed along the line (m/s). No texture: the soft round sprite, lit like the
# ground, with a little violet glow of their own (carried by magic).
ParticleEffect BuilderStones
	Emitter Stones
		Rate 0
		SpawnRadius 0.15
		ConeAngle 2
		Speed 5.5 7
		Life 1 1
		Gravity 0
		Drag 0
		Turbulence 0.6 0.6 0
		Size 0.15 0.11
		SizeVariance 0.5
		Spin 4
		ColorStart 0.55, 0.52, 0.5, 1
		ColorEnd 0.5, 0.47, 0.48, 1
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0.25
		Additivity 0
		FadeIn 0.08
		FadeOutStart 0.85
		SoftFade 0.05
